      "snippet": "The pane's bare /modernize-review took the name of the plugin's own review command, so typing the short form in a pane-enabled session opened the pane's cards instead of the pop-up review. The pane's version is now /modernize-review-pane, and /modernize-review always runs the plugin command. Both st",
