      "url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/commit/d49ccb3844876e35262a32f145b7b717646da733",
      "snippet": "A rule named only by a skipped or pending test no longer counts as covered. It is listed as \"named, not run\" and fails the rules check. A test-only folder is listed as tooling and gets no verdict. The verify command tries malformed records only when the person asked for exact behavior, so a proof lo",
